{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"1097","tmdb_id":"movie/1097","media_type":"movie","title":"死亡代理人","original_title":"エルゴプラクシー","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rObNchuE0AHF6KSsA5bVxpj2Lre.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGAgj9QztYjSsYCnZhDMgBUzQKU.jpg","overview":"这个世界构建在人与机器共同生活的基础之上。在这个世界里，感情是不被允许且也不需要的事，这个科技无限发达，人情无限冷漠的都市被称之为“Romdo”。每个乐园的人都有一台属于自己的机器人，被称之为“Autoreiv”，用来检测人的感情波动；而人类也在提防Autoreiv，避免他们感染上名为“Cogito”的自我意识。  这种相互制约的关系被发生在Romdo的一系列杀人事件所打破。调查此事的市民情报局的Rilu（齐藤梨绘 配音）发现这些杀人事件比想象中复杂和黑暗的多，随着调查的深入，Rilu的人身安全开始受到威胁，许多怪物、机械相继登场，一切都在阻止着她的调查。到底Romdo的背后暗藏着什么真相，让我们随着Rilu来一一揭晓。","release_date":"2006-02-25","first_air_date":"2006-02-25","year":"2006","runtime":"","episode_run_time":"25","number_of_episodes":23,"number_of_seasons":1,"genres":["动画","悬疑","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"languages":["日本語"],"countries":["Japan"],"tmdb_rating":"7.7 / 10 from 429 users","tmdb_rating_average":7.7,"tmdb_votes":429,"imdb_id":"tt0791205","imdb_link":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0791205/","imdb_rating":"7.8 / 10 from 19414 users","imdb_rating_average":"7.8","imdb_votes":"19414","directors":[],"producers":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":2065290,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"河内山隆","original_name":"河内山隆","popularity":0.4934,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"5b30a99a0e0a2616fa00027b","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1126290,"known_for_department":"Production","name":"松田章男","original_name":"松田章男","popularity":0.5529,"profile_path":"/t0BKOFH8IBAkfowSMbkLXVhNd2e.jpg","credit_id":"5b30aa120e0a261530000261","department":"Production","job":"Producer"}],"writers":[],"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1222156,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"齐藤梨绘","original_name":"斉藤梨絵","popularity":0.7315,"profile_path":"/2xtvi8q3hEZqJekW9lM9MJ6Yhqf.jpg","character":"Re-l Mayer (voice)","credit_id":"525415f819c295794037aab4","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":555099,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"游佐浩二","original